  "attribution": "Original procedural vector artwork and original synthesized audio created for this project with GitHub Copilot assistance. Chola-period royal-court and temple-architecture inspiration; an imaginative modern interpretation, not authenticated historical portraits or reconstructions. Kings evoke the setting of Rajaraja I; queens are imagined court women and jacks imagined commanders, with no asserted identities or relationships. No Microsoft artwork, recordings, online models, sampled instruments, or external media used. Music is a gentle original pentatonic composition with veena-, flute-, and mridangam-inspired synthesis, not a professional performance or an authentic raga rendition."
